## Implementation Task: Review Decisions API + Workflow Advance

Project: `C:\Users\SKKU\Downloads\codex\recruiting_page`

### Context
`lib/review-decisions.ts` has been created with CRUD functions. We need API endpoints.
`lib/permissions.ts` has `checkPermission()` function.
`lib/constants.ts` has `PROCEDURE_STEPS`, `getProcedureType`, `getNextStatus`.

### Read these files first
- `lib/review-decisions.ts` — the CRUD functions we'll call
- `lib/permissions.ts` — checkPermission function signature
- `lib/auth.ts` — requireUser function (returns user with id, role)
- `lib/constants.ts` — getProcedureType, getNextStatus, PROCEDURE_STEPS
- `app/api/permissions/route.ts` — example API pattern to follow

### What to create

#### 1. `app/api/review-decisions/route.ts`

```typescript
// GET /api/review-decisions?requestId=X&stepKey=Y (stepKey optional)
// - requireUser()
// - get requestId from searchParams
// - call getReviewDecisions(requestId, stepKey)
// - return JSON array

// POST /api/review-decisions
// - requireUser()
// - checkPermission(user.role, "workflow.review", "edit") → 403 if denied
// - read body: { requestId, candidateId, stepKey, decision?, comment?, reviewDataJson? }
// - call createReviewDecision({ ...body, reviewerId: user.id })
// - return created record
```

#### 2. `app/api/review-decisions/[id]/route.ts`

```typescript
// PATCH /api/review-decisions/[id]
// - requireUser()
// - checkPermission(user.role, "workflow.review", "edit") → 403 if denied
// - read body: { decision?, comment?, reviewDataJson? }
// - call updateReviewDecision(id, body)
// - return updated record or 404
```

#### 3. `app/api/workflow/advance/route.ts`

```typescript
// POST /api/workflow/advance
// - requireUser()
// - checkPermission(user.role, "workflow.advance", "edit") → 403 if denied
// - read body: { requestId }
// - get recruitment request from DB
// - determine procedureType from hiring_type using getProcedureType()
// - get current status
// - find current step's stepKey from PROCEDURE_STEPS
// - check allCandidatesReviewed(requestId, stepKey)
// - if not all reviewed: return 400 "모든 후보자 심사를 완료해주세요"
// - get nextStatus using getNextStatus()
// - if no next status: return 400 "이미 마지막 단계입니다"
// - update recruitment_requests.status to nextStatus
// - return { success: true, newStatus }
```

### API patterns to follow
- Use `NextRequest` and `NextResponse` from `next/server`
- `requireUser()` returns `{ id, username, role, departmentCode }`
- `checkPermission(role, resource, action)` returns boolean (sync)
- Return `NextResponse.json({ error: "FORBIDDEN" }, { status: 403 })` on permission denial
- Use `await params` for dynamic route params (Next.js 16 pattern)

### Verify
Run `npm run build` — must pass.

### IMPORTANT
- Do NOT modify any existing files
- Only CREATE new API route files
- Follow existing API patterns exactly
- Make sure the `app/api/workflow/` directory is created (it's new)

